        "heading_zmhLEp": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "About our Chicago Flagship",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_Nat9dh": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We are proud to introduce A Ma Maniére Chicago, a three-story destination where luxury retail, exceptional hospitality, and cultural experiences converge. Located in Chicago’s Fulton Market district, the space brings together the Galerie lounge, the Maison retail experience, an open-air courtyard, and two thoughtfully designed living suites honoring the enduring legacies of Fred Hampton and Michael Jordan. Every element reflects our ongoing vision of creating environments that are as intentional and considered as the culture that inspires them.<br/>Chicago’s influence on culture, creativity, and leadership extends well beyond the city itself. Inspired by the people and perspectives that have shaped its identity, A Ma Maniére Chicago is an invitation to gather, exchange ideas, and cultivate meaningful connections. Through curated experiences, intimate gatherings, and a thoughtful approach to hospitality, our intention is to become a part of the city’s footprint.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
